The Cost of Policy
Administrative power is balanced by systemic friction. The Governor Surcharge (1% of total treasury) is triggered whenever a leader adjusts localized tax policies; these funds are routed directly to the Arena Center to prevent exploit-driven policy volatility. Furthermore, the Luxury Tax applies a 1% surcharge to any "Master Tier" equipment purchase, routed to the Global Faucet. These mechanisms ensure the "Industrial Seal" is maintained, forcing elite players to contribute to global liquidity.
With macro-governance established, the focus must shift to the operational specialists who drive the internal efficiency of these territories.
